contains the resulting values and expressions.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1926c2e4-3be4-470f-bde1-174fc44764b0"],

Cell["\<\
13 of 13 manuscript cross-check groups passed. The calculation used 287 grid \
points at 55 working digits and seven reevaluations at 75 working digits.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0e72dab-0bab-4d51-98df-cb0da62edcc6"],

Cell["\<\
The largest sampled scaled error was \
8.368197952771194656246194508900493424285942314759891498404438034386e-2, at q \
= 100 and x = -1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd76c0f4-59c3-4df6-8e30-694c1e982a8d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 BoxData["The largest absolute difference from the manuscript table was \
4.020185626455647e-13. The largest difference between the three Abel-Plana \
integrals and their zeta evaluations was ", 
  $CellContext`numeroCSV[
  Rational[19, 
     421249166674228746791672110734681729275580381602196445017243910144] 
   69218866568267110856005^Rational[1, 2]], "."]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->\
"14b9f30c-ca41-460c-82e5-1a4f20b74bbd"],

Cell["\<\
The exact main-bound coefficient is \
371609064358084350147257/86597871701497153200000, strictly below 43/10. The \
appendix coefficient is 356452924783991052355217/86597871701497153200000, \
strictly below 4117/1000.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f75a39f-43c6-45cf-89cc-1d94f19a1fcf"],

Cell["\<\
The numerical checks apply to the sampled points. The domain-wide inequality \
relies on the analytic argument in the manuscript.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2c0e0688-be47-4750-9a30-069f2423425b"],

Cell["\<\
Kernel messages from the manuscript checks: {}. Original inputs with aborted, \
failed or timed-out evaluations: 0.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8976ba80-2f02-4bd6-ba42-c7737da76aa3"],

Cell["\<\
Source file SHA-256 checks before and after the run: all five originals match.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d328323c-f18f-410e-9b0e-a7386e460b2c"],

Cell["\<\
The comparison used Table 1 and the formulas in the archived LaTeX source. \
The corresponding manuscript PDF is included for reference. The plot exports \
were produced by this Mathematica run.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"900767c2-d4f4-4852-b561-e09f8d864481"],

